            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.15.16+ACT.15.17+ACT.15.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tic 15:16-18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I ceng’ maeca abiting’o hema pa Daudi m’upodho, man abiculo ka in’umome; man abiting’o gire m’ubam malu, e abigome calu i ceng’ ma con; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kara gimwony dong Edom, ku thek ceke m’ulwongre ku nyinga, Yehova m’utimo maeni wacu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nen, ceng’ ubino, Yehova wacu, nia jafur birubo janyar, man janyon nyingulok birubo jacoi kodhi; man gudi bitono pigulok ma mit, e ungulu gudi ceke biloi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man abidwoko ng’eca mi dhanu para Israel, e gibigomo adhura m’ubedo ni uvuru, man gibibedo i igi; man gibipidho podho mir ulok, man gibimadhu pigulokne; gibitimo pothi bende, man gibicamu nying’gi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E abipidhogi wi ng’om migi, man jubikabugi kendo ngo kud i ng’om migi m’amio igi, Yehova Mungu peri wacu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.9.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
